                        "form": "die Hotspots"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a70fdfc2-8f52-3af7-9bb3-73ee54306693",
                        "entry_id": "fe2aa9d0-959e-3972-ad49-8f9ba1d4eade",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Stelle im Erbgut von Organismen, die sehr leicht durch Mutation oder Rekombination der Erbsubstanz veränderbar ist"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Genetik"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "26dd9406-a47b-4285-a0d9-880afa3cc8fc",
                                "sense_id": "a70fdfc2-8f52-3af7-9bb3-73ee54306693",
                                "text": "„Wenn der Körper Ei- oder Samenzellen produziert, werden weibliche und männliche Chromosomenpaare neu kombiniert und Erbinformationen ausgetauscht. Hin und wieder kommt es dabei zu ungünstigen Konstellationen, aus denen genetische Erkrankungen entstehen können. Minisatelliten werden in Hotspots, d.h. bevorzugten Stellen für die Einleitung der Rekombination, aktiv.“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ab61dfc8-f77b-35cb-9cd8-d506c9f726da",
                        "entry_id": "fe2aa9d0-959e-3972-ad49-8f9ba1d4eade",
                        "glosses": [
                            "ungewöhnlich heiße Region des Erdmantels, die zu erhöhter vulkanischer Aktivität in der darüberliegenden Erdkruste führt"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9bd46328-131c-4b78-80da-f3a6a8fa1bf1",
                                "sense_id": "ab61dfc8-f77b-35cb-9cd8-d506c9f726da",
                                "text": "Die Galapagos-Inseln liegen auf einem so genannten Hotspot der Erdkruste."
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4f762167-0334-3f2e-9cad-789bb22ad4d3",
                        "entry_id": "fe2aa9d0-959e-3972-ad49-8f9ba1d4eade",
                        "glosses": [
                            "öffentlicher, drahtloser Einwahlpunkt ins Internet"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Informationsverarbeitung"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1c239eb3-27cb-41a3-95fc-ea63db5bca5f",
                                "sense_id": "4f762167-0334-3f2e-9cad-789bb22ad4d3",
                                "text": "„Gemeint sind nicht die üblichen Internetcafés mit ihrem eigenwilligen Charme aus Großraumbüro und Hacker-Höhle, sondern Cafés, die einen Hotspot (Einwahlpunkt) eingerichtet haben, an dem man mit seinem eigenen W-LAN-fähigen Notebook ins Internet gehen kann.“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"3\""
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f307d2c5-5775-32d9-8bdf-73e8d8463e86",
                        "entry_id": "fe2aa9d0-959e-3972-ad49-8f9ba1d4eade",
                        "glosses": [
                            "besonders hervorgehobener Punkt oder Text auf einer Webseite, hinter dem ein Link hinterlegt ist"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Informationsverarbeitung"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5d1849b8-02a3-469a-a6a3-5ffd75546de5",
                                "sense_id": "f307d2c5-5775-32d9-8bdf-73e8d8463e86",
                                "text": "Im Bild können dann auch so genannte Hotspots definiert werden, anklickbare Bereiche innerhalb des Bildes."
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"4\""
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b699d9d6-ca08-3253-a4fa-1d443567d6d2",
                        "entry_id": "fe2aa9d0-959e-3972-ad49-8f9ba1d4eade",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Ort, der eine große Anziehungskraft auf Menschen ausübt"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "general"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "43066817-66a1-45eb-8616-024a63ad0bf5",
                                "sense_id": "b699d9d6-ca08-3253-a4fa-1d443567d6d2",
                                "text": "„Vielleicht hat es sogar etwas Gutes, wenn sich die Massen auf Hotspots wie Sölden, St. Anton und Ischgl konzentrieren.“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"5\""
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "fccacd95-e756-39d8-a72c-e28e1458f3d2",
                        "entry_id": "fe2aa9d0-959e-3972-ad49-8f9ba1d4eade",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Ort, der besonders von etwas betroffen ist, zum Beispiel durch ein großes Konfliktpotential oder großes Ansteckungsrisiko ausgezeichnet ist"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "general"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d40d3b3f-c547-42d7-8d2b-bb5f8a6cf6f2",
                                "sense_id": "fccacd95-e756-39d8-a72c-e28e1458f3d2",
                                "text": "„Typhusinfektionen werden in der Regel von Fernreisen importiert, wobei Indien ein Hotspot ist.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3709e09c-f165-457b-a7ab-070e52aa1274",
                                "sense_id": "fccacd95-e756-39d8-a72c-e28e1458f3d2",
                                "text": "„Ich verdränge die Frage erst einmal, gehe über zur Tagesform und berichte während der Nachrichten im Morgenmagazin von den Hotspots dieser Welt.“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"6\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "0bcd5664-6e71-4e1e-a096-8a5a34d8a698",
                        "source_entry_id": "fe2aa9d0-959e-3972-ad49-8f9ba1d4eade",
                        "source_sense_id": "a70fdfc2-8f52-3af7-9bb3-73ee54306693",
                        "target_lang_word": "hot spot",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "hot spot",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8ce0b630-cd49-3162-abd2-60519827be47",
                                        "entry_id": "634e38c6-e0b9-30a6-8ce6-01f32c5374c9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A location which has a higher temperature or amount of radiation than surrounding areas."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6ca58440-a111-46b5-8a8e-42a3c09a13b8",
                                                "sense_id": "8ce0b630-cd49-3162-abd2-60519827be47",
                                                "text": "[Y]our microwave may have an area in which more energy is concentrated. To test for a hot spot, place sliced white bread across the bottom of your microwave, so that the slices are touching, forming a solid layer."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "55abfab0-6fb4-3e76-96a1-21807207b173",
                                        "entry_id": "634e38c6-e0b9-30a6-8ce6-01f32c5374c9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A location which has a higher temperature or amount of radiation than surrounding areas.",
                                            "A part of a forest fire which is burning actively."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5eeed3d2-1841-3cfb-8f1e-ef2b6159500a",
                                        "entry_id": "634e38c6-e0b9-30a6-8ce6-01f32c5374c9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A location which has a higher temperature or amount of radiation than surrounding areas.",
                                            "The surface manifestation of a plume of molten material that rises from deep in a celestial body's mantle."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "abc558ca-4927-4604-955b-453d519d7857",
                                                "sense_id": "5eeed3d2-1841-3cfb-8f1e-ef2b6159500a",
                                                "text": "While researchers can see the path that Yellowstone burned as the hot spot migrated from Oregon across Idaho and into Wyoming, discerning one eruption from another has been a chore as most volcanic deposits are scattered across vast landscapes in a chaotic jumble."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "27031967-c4c8-39a8-b3ec-a8c5ee9282eb",
                                        "entry_id": "634e38c6-e0b9-30a6-8ce6-01f32c5374c9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A location which has a higher temperature or amount of radiation than surrounding areas.",
                                            "An area of high radioactive contamination."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "23e69317-3417-3bcb-849f-c53de3570699",
                                        "entry_id": "634e38c6-e0b9-30a6-8ce6-01f32c5374c9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A location which has a higher temperature or amount of radiation than surrounding areas.",
                                            "Synonym of heiligenschein (“an optical phenomenon which creates a bright spot around the shadow of the viewer's head, when the surface on which the shadow falls has special optical characteristics”)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "92411d57-be8b-3add-b21f-af9152de1b31",
                                        "entry_id": "634e38c6-e0b9-30a6-8ce6-01f32c5374c9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A location which has a higher temperature or amount of radiation than surrounding areas.",
                                            "An infected lesion in dogs or other furry mammals caused by excessive itching."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f4470806-dbea-3401-8f98-8029ca810b22",
                                        "entry_id": "634e38c6-e0b9-30a6-8ce6-01f32c5374c9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A place notable for a high level of activity or danger."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fc4774c7-fdc0-4477-9190-528ed36055bc",
                                                "sense_id": "f4470806-dbea-3401-8f98-8029ca810b22",
                                                "text": "Great guns! messmates, but if Flint was living, this would be a hot spot for you and me. Six they were, and six are we; and bones is what they are now."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7b0de6be-840f-421c-8518-7f21ccd1bd4f",
                                                "sense_id": "f4470806-dbea-3401-8f98-8029ca810b22",
                                                "text": "For instance, Toronto's Bloor Street Viaduct was, alas, a suicide hotspot – in fact, it was second only to the Golden Gate Bridge in terms of the number of bridge-related suicides."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9fb0c6b0-d1f1-428e-a233-8bf1956037b4",
                                                "sense_id": "f4470806-dbea-3401-8f98-8029ca810b22",
                                                "text": "I might never have learned my name or met my birth family if I hadn't ended up in the hospital in Rhode Island in 2007, after traveling to a trifecta of malaria hotspots: Mali, Egypt and Colombia."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c70a8dd3-d824-345b-92cd-c4f45ae2c084",
                                        "entry_id": "634e38c6-e0b9-30a6-8ce6-01f32c5374c9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A place notable for a high level of activity or danger.",
                                            "A dangerous place of violent political unrest."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6b7b152f-c136-399e-8a09-41724b641505",
                                        "entry_id": "634e38c6-e0b9-30a6-8ce6-01f32c5374c9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A place notable for a high level of activity or danger.",
                                            "A lively and entertaining place, such as a nightclub."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1bb5f835-9160-4080-8946-21520d5adf30",
                                                "sense_id": "6b7b152f-c136-399e-8a09-41724b641505",
                                                "text": "It has been reported that an entertainment took place not long ago in a certain \"hot spot\" in New York City, and it has been charged that members of the Federal Communications Commission were present; that they got into a drunken brawl; and in the brawl some woman was hurt, her arm twisted."
                                            }
